{"id":"house_ca_13_kevin-lincoln","n":"Kevin Lincoln","p":"Republican","race":{"mode":"house","st":"CA","d":"13","city":null},"updated":"2026-11-09","bio":"Kevin Jeffery Lincoln II (born October 28, 1980) is an American politician, businessman, and pastor who served as the mayor of Stockton, California, from 2021 to 2025. A member of the Republican Party, Lincoln defeated Democratic incumbent Michael Tubbs in the 2020 election.","bioSrc":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kevin_Lincoln_(politician)","wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kevin_Lincoln_(politician)","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/KevinLincoln.jpg/330px-KevinLincoln.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imgSrc":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:KevinLincoln.jpg","site":"https://www.kevinlincolnforcongress.com/","siteKind":"official","offices":["Mayor of Stockton (2021–2025)"],"qid":"Q110622361"}